@startuml
title L4 (Code): inference_comp (ml_service) — паттерн Strategy

hide empty members

class TimeSeriesData <<dataclass, frozen>> {
  +values: Tuple[float, ...]
  +from_sequence(values: Sequence[float]): TimeSeriesData
}

class PredictionResult <<dataclass, frozen>> {
  +horizon: int
  +values: Tuple[float, ...]
  +model_name: str
}

interface ForecastStrategy <<ABC>> {
  +name: str
  +predict(data: TimeSeriesData, horizon: int): PredictionResult
}

class ForecastContext {
  -strategy: ForecastStrategy
  +strategy_name: str
  +set_strategy(strategy: ForecastStrategy): None
  +predict(data: TimeSeriesData, horizon: int): PredictionResult
}

class XGBoostStrategy {
  -n_lags: int
  -factory: Callable[[], RegressorLike]
  +name: str
  +predict(data: TimeSeriesData, horizon: int): PredictionResult
}

class ARIMAStrategy {
  -order: Tuple[int, int, int]
  -min_observations: int
  -factory: Callable[[Sequence[float], Tuple[int, int, int]], ArimaModel]
  +name: str
  +predict(data: TimeSeriesData, horizon: int): PredictionResult
}

interface RegressorLike <<Protocol>> {
  +fit(x: ndarray, y: ndarray): object
  +predict(x: ndarray): ndarray
}

interface ArimaModel <<Protocol>> {
  +fit(): ArimaFitted
}

interface ArimaFitted <<Protocol>> {
  +forecast(steps: int): Sequence[float]
}

class LeastSquaresRegressor <<имитация XGBRegressor>> {
  +fit(x: ndarray, y: ndarray): LeastSquaresRegressor
  +predict(x: ndarray): ndarray
}

class DriftArimaModel <<имитация ARIMA>> {
  +fit(): ArimaFitted
}

class InferenceError <<exception>>
class InvalidTimeSeriesError <<exception>>
class InvalidHorizonError <<exception>>
class InsufficientDataError <<exception>>
class ModelNotAvailableError <<exception>>
class ModelFitError <<exception>>

' Strategy: контекст использует интерфейс, модель подменяется во время выполнения
ForecastContext --> ForecastStrategy : uses
ForecastStrategy <|.. XGBoostStrategy
ForecastStrategy <|.. ARIMAStrategy

' Модели данных
ForecastStrategy ..> TimeSeriesData
ForecastStrategy ..> PredictionResult

' Зависимости стратегий от внешних моделей (xgboost, statsmodels)
XGBoostStrategy --> RegressorLike : factory()
ARIMAStrategy --> ArimaModel : factory()
ArimaModel ..> ArimaFitted

' Имитации реализуют те же интерфейсы
RegressorLike <|.. LeastSquaresRegressor
ArimaModel <|.. DriftArimaModel

' Иерархия исключений
InferenceError <|-- InvalidTimeSeriesError
InferenceError <|-- InvalidHorizonError
InferenceError <|-- InsufficientDataError
InferenceError <|-- ModelNotAvailableError
InferenceError <|-- ModelFitError

XGBoostStrategy ..> InsufficientDataError : throws
ARIMAStrategy ..> InsufficientDataError : throws
XGBoostStrategy ..> ModelNotAvailableError : throws
ARIMAStrategy ..> ModelNotAvailableError : throws
ForecastContext ..> InvalidHorizonError : throws
TimeSeriesData ..> InvalidTimeSeriesError : throws

note right of ForecastStrategy
  L3: ml_service / inference_comp
  Признаки: feature_engineer_comp
  Модели: model_registry_comp
end note

@enduml
